{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53589","headline":"咏廿四气诗 白露八月节 · 元稹","name":"咏廿四气诗 白露八月节","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露沾蔬草白，天气转青高。\n叶下和秋吹，惊看两鬓毛（一作「毫」）。\n养羞因野鸟，爲客[讶]蓬蒿。\n火急收田种，晨昏莫辞劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}